      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds like you're experiencing a profound sense of obsolescence, which is a deeply painful feeling when your life's work is suddenly challenged. Please know that the shift in technology doesn't invalidate the rigorous, foundational knowledge you've built over four decades. Instead, consider how your deep, nuanced understanding of language can now guide or critique these massive new models. Your expertise is a valuable anchor in this rapidly evolving landscape.",
